# AudioMuse line-ending policy.
#
# tools/build-knowledge-index.ps1 always writes UTF-8 (no BOM) with LF, and
# tools/validate-knowledge-index.ps1 byte-compares the committed files under
# indexes/ against freshly generated output. Without this policy a clone made
# with Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) checks those files out with
# CRLF, and index validation reports a false "stale index" on a pristine clone.
#
# Normalize every tracked text file to LF in the repository and in the working
# tree on all platforms; keep known binary assets untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.docx binary
